        <item>
            <title>WallP 1.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>WallP 1.4.0</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Collections now sync completely — fixed a bug that capped each collection at 240 images and silently skipped sketchy/NSFW wallpapers. Hit Sync Now to pull in the images that were missing.</li>
                    <li>New multi-monitor option: show a different wallpaper on each display (default) or the same wallpaper across all displays.</li>
                    <li>The menu-bar shuffle button now shows a "Next" icon when display order is set to By Name or By Date Created, since it advances in sequence.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
