            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>WallP 1.3.4</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Wallpaper now changes immediately when the first image downloads — no more waiting for sync to complete</li>
                    <li>Added "Every day" option to wallpaper rotation and sync schedules</li>
                    <li>Auto-update schedule: choose Every Day, Every Week, or Manual</li>
                    <li>Max images per collection increased from 500 to 1000</li>
